# 62. TESTS — REQUIRED

Add automated tests where feasible for:

## Enrollment rules

- biometric unavailable before PIN setup
- unlocked session alone cannot enroll without PIN confirmation
- invalid PIN blocks enrollment
- duplicate credential rejected

## PRF

- no PRF → biometric vault unlock not enabled
- valid PRF wrapper → correct master key restored
- wrong PRF material → unwrap fails

## Challenge

- expired challenge rejected
- reused challenge rejected
- wrong challenge rejected

## WebAuthn server verification

- wrong origin rejected
- wrong RP ID rejected
- invalid signature rejected
- unknown credential rejected

## Removal

- requires PIN
- removes biometric credential only
- PIN still unlocks vault

## Wipe

- biometric state deleted

## Backup

- biometric credentials excluded

