# 67. FINAL USER EXPERIENCE

The intended product experience is:

## First use

```text
Create PIN
↓
PIN becomes primary recovery credential
↓
enter vault
↓
optionally enable biometric login from Settings
```

## Future login — Method 1

```text
Mechanical PIN
↓
Master Key unwrapped
↓
Vault opens
```

## Future login — Method 2

```text
Fingerprint / Windows Hello
↓
WebAuthn verifies user
↓
PRF securely derives local wrapping key
↓
Master Key unwrapped
↓
Vault opens
```

Both methods unlock the SAME encrypted Aman Rayan vault.

